  "bookId": "2CO",
  "reference": "2 Korinto 11",
  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng qoomár bar dakti'iimar'eé' káh, alók geera án kuungá' in sa qiqtliindá'. Ar ló', án kuungá' i tsuwa sa qiqtliindá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng gura' iga óh as kuungá'. Guruuwí aníng iga oh, amór i dahhi a amór Mungú. Asma kuungá' a adór /amaatliito'ór hhoohhoo' ar taa kwatiitiiká. Aníng al'axweesani aga haniís, /amaatliito'oorí ngiwa haniis dír hhawaatuú wák. Nee hhawaatuuwí an Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng a daimiít as kuungá' tunduwa al/ayi baraá inslawayhunge, tam kuungá' sla'aarirhúng tidá' ur ar hhoohhoo' ar Kristo kuwa sla'a' kari geexeerá', adoodár dayshamooduú al/aymusmo aáng Hawa ngira al/aáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma kuungá' umuúqo heewo oo naa hardah amorhúng un sa qiqtliindá', kudá' kángw Yesú hatlá' gu alki/iít. Yésuudá' inooín ta alki/iiti a kudá' atén taa alki/itaniiká. Slám kuungá' qeeruú hatlá' u ya/a/aandá'. Inós a Qeeruudá' hhoohhooeeká oo kuungá' taa ilaoté'. Nee slám kuungá' Ya/abtór hho' ar hatlá' an ilaoohiindá'. Ya/abtoorí a tidá' atén naa dirhúngií alki/itaniiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Án ngi slaá' ya/abuuserhúng tidá' ló'wa uren gár aníng iwa ba/ i káhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala tam aníng axweesani alki/ituuwo a xuaakahe, ala kangwdá' aníng ni axwees u xuú'. Gaarí atén nga gwa/atisaán dirhunge umuúqo daqto nee ar umuúqo loohiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár aníng Ya/abtór hho' ar Mungú ngiwa alki/iít dirhunge, gár aníng naa ilaóh dirhúng wa ale i káhh, aníng tina niinaweés as kuungá' tawa múk urén tleehhita'. Xáy aníng adoorí ngiwa tleéhh ana dakuúsi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár aníng gadiyeé ngiwa tleéhh tla/angwhúng wa ale, aníng tina qáy nee kríshaanoó dimbadimbé oo yaamaá hatlá', as kuungá' nuwa sagadiyuus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár aníng niwa amorhúng i dirii', tam gaa ngiwa slaá', aníng heé naa daawitimís dirhunge i kaahh. Asma hhaeedá' Makedoniár dahhá', muruudá'sleémeero aníng naa slaá' nguna huwiyé'. Aníng ana ló'wa ilakaahareés as kuungá' munduwa diitsakwár ar áw. Nee slám aníng an adoodár kumaamiít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoodá' looeemaá Kristo ir baraaeé' i dirii'iya', xirfuuwí ku baloó hingeesiiká dir'eene baraá yaamaá Akaya sleémeerowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma milá gár adoorí án ngis kah? A an kuungá' nun sla'aakáhe? Aasla'áy. Mungú ga xuu' adór aníng kuungá' nur slaa'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng a kumiít adoorí ngiwa tlehhiit, as masók mukduú hatlá' pa/aangw munguwa sláy, oo tiwa kilooín xirfayeemisiya' tawa ooi, «Atén gadiyér Mungú an tlehhiitaán adoodár inooín wa ale.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma múk adoorí a ya/abuusér loeeká, ala a ya/abuusér lama. Inooín a múk gadiyér tleéhh ar al/ayma, nee slám inooín kilooín tin slaqsoó ya/abuusér Kristó tlehhiitiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala a gár waa/oo/amoorooká. Asma tam Neetlaangw inósuú kilá' tin warqeemiis tawa slaqsoó malaykamoó gwa/aateema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe a gár waa/oo/amoorooká sleeme sagadiyuuseerós tiwa warqeemis tawa adór sagadiyuusér gan'amu. Ala alhhe'eesaywo inooín sakwasleema kan sláy, ar adoodá' tlehhemi'ii'ín i dirii'iya'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xaa aníng kuungá' nu malé firiím kuungá' ma kaahara' aníng a daktani. Ala adoosíng bar katá', aníng ya/aamaré' tawa daktani, as pa/aangw nguwa slaw tiwa kilooeé' xirfayees gár niinawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma gaarí án ni kah i amór Aakoó dahhká, ala xirfayeemisuueé' kwí aníng tiwa kilooeé' xirfayeemiis, un tlehhiít adór daktantá wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma múk yaariír i deer oo ti kilooín xirfayeemiís as muruú baraakaá yaamu, ala tam aníng sleeme tin adoodár xirfayeemiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma kuungá' a ló'wa sla'á' daktana kawa sa qiqtliinda', kuungaásingá' ló'wa sagalooár koomá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' a qiqtliindá' hee kuungá' burna lawaale tleéhh, laqaá hee bira daqaari'iít ar daqaari'iimarhúng, laqaá hee bur naa ohín, nee laqaá hee bur naa waaqaqaá', nee laqaá hee bur naa tlaaqarma' muúx. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng adoorí an káh ar mure, asma atén qoomár tawa amorhúng i diriiaan, adoorí tlehharo aga qiitlaniiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng daxta an oo' adór daktantá wa ale, hee bir deer oo qiítl oo ti kilós xirfayeemiís gawaá umuúqo gaaro, aníng sleeme a qiítl tiwa xirfayees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín a múk Ebraniáro? Tam aníng sleeme. Inooín a múk Israelíwo? Tam aníng sleeme. Inooín a xwaylár Abrahamúwo? Tam aníng sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín a sagadiyuusér Kristówo? Aníng daxta an adór slarhhamá wa axweés, aníng a sagadiyusmoó Kristo oo ak hhoó' ta inooine. Aníng gadiyeé ana ak tleéhh ta inooine. Aníng tina tsegiít daqtá yaariire ta inooine. Nee slám aníng tina ak muúx ta inooine. Aníng afkú bohoongw ngun wa kikií/ daqtá yaariire ta inooine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tina muúx sagaáwa kooán wa ale nee múk Yahudi, qaway mibeeri tám nee gwaleél umuúqo muxtaaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tina muúx sagaáwa tám wa ale nee múk Roma, ar hhara, nee tina tlaquút ar tlaa/e sagaáwa wake. Sagaáwa tám miringamo ina qeqtín baraá tlawto aníng ana hoót baraá ma'áy wa ale, xweera nee tlaatla/aango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá aaiieé' awa yaariire tsaxwaá yaariir in wa /akumaamiít, tsaxwaá yau, nee tsaxwaá fisuuse, tsaxwa as múk xooror'eé', nee as múk xoordaá hatlá' sleeme, tsaxwaá baraá gixsadu nee tsaxwaá baraá darma, tsaxwaá baraá tlawi, tsaxwa as mukdá' káh inooín a hhae, ala laatí inooín a hhaeewooká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng aga daawimaamiít as gadiyér yaariir. Daqtá yaariire ana dalaá', nee slám ana slahhahhaá' as qwari nee waxe. Daqtá yaariire muruú /ayma ugwa slawiiká, ana slahhahhaá' as tsaaqwa nee /aankwets. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tí sleémeero bar mawaana, huwár hatlá' ar ni koom i deer umuúqo daqto as daanduú kríshaanáy sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma heeko bur ku daqaatlaákw baraá haratlintaaoorose, aníng sleeme ti daqaatlaákw. Laqaá barnaxes kooko aa huú' baraá tlakweemaá i alé, aníng a ló'wa gurhaamuút.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng barnaxes gár tiwa hariím, a tin xirfayeés, aníng tin xirfayeés as daqaatlakwer'eé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú, Baabuú Aako Yesu, kudá' xiríf ay alhhe'eesay wasle, inós ga xuu' adór aníng lama ngir kaahaaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár aníng niwa baraá gixsár Damasko, ga/aawusmoó waawutmo Areta inós gixsár Damasko gana xún as án tiwa oohi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng tiri aweeriís ar lakwaanti ar pa/ángw baraá koo/ír gixsa, gawaá adoorihe niri ba/ám baraá dabaawose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.11.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
